 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "errors[h] is the error count of hour h. An hour is bad when errors[h] > threshold. A window is every run of duration consecutive hours inside the list. A window triggers an alert when its number of bad hours times 100 is at least percent times duration. Return the number of windows that trigger; when duration exceeds the number of hours there are no windows.",
